      "username": "ransikerandeni",
      "name": "Ransike Randeni",
      "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:38:32.565Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have created a custom DocType named “Short Leave Application”, and it’s naming series is set as below,</p>\n<p>Naming Rule: Expression</p>\n<p>Auto Name: format:HR-SLA-{YYYY}-{####}</p>\n<p>For the first few documents, the naming series worked fine,</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/a/9a0b53d2dc574f6757a43ebd17a82d950594ea94.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9a0b53d2dc574f6757a43ebd17a82d950594ea94\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-12-01 at 1.02.27 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/a/9a0b53d2dc574f6757a43ebd17a82d950594ea94.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-12-01 at 1.02.27 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"lYJNyM64riCb80q56tbS9roTI0Y\" width=\"220\" height=\"242\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-12-01 at 1.02.27 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">220×242 3.45 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>But after many entries, it has skipped 408 counts from 235 to 643,</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/4/74eb386a50ae549dc9517192f16701a27f8b4a89.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/74eb386a50ae549dc9517192f16701a27f8b4a89\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-12-01 at 1.06.47 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/4/74eb386a50ae549dc9517192f16701a27f8b4a89.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-12-01 at 1.06.47 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"gGjljVTOZxBScYEey1ljgaSQntD\" width=\"180\" height=\"500\" data-dominant-color=\"F3F1F1\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-12-01 at 1.06.47 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">236×653 7.17 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The above records were sorted according to the ID and there were no records created in between.</p>",
