    {
      "id": 487867,
      "username": "Hemil_Sangani",
      "name": "Hemil Sangani",
      "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:55:19.385Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can use Document Naming Rule for this:</p>\n<p>Navigate to <strong>Home → Document Naming Rule</strong> and click <strong>New</strong>.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Select your <strong>Document Type</strong> (your custom DocType) from the dropdown.</li>\n<li>Set a <strong>Priority</strong> value (e.g., <code>10</code> for higher precedence — higher values are applied first).</li>\n<li>In the <strong>Naming</strong> section, enter your desired <strong>Prefix</strong> (e.g., <code>\"CUST-\"</code>) and specify the <strong>Counter Start</strong> value (the number from which naming should begin).</li>\n<li>Save the rule.</li>\n</ol>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/ce7236/{size}.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "like_count": null,
      "like_action": null,
      "Reads": 32,
      "wikis": null,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_view_edit_history": true,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "version": 2,
      "last_edited_at": null,
      "edited_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": 487868,
      "username": "shaileshsaini",
      "name": "Shailesh",
      "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:01:21.915Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In ERPNext, using <strong>Document Naming Rule</strong>, you can start a counter from 0 by creating a custom <strong>Naming Series</strong> for your DocType. For Eg  in Document naming rule set : DOC- and select the doctype. give the prefix and start series from.</p>\n<p>Just see the screenshot:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/0/106fc050a901b07eac3274f00674cdd42f1ea46e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/106fc050a901b07eac3274f00674cdd42f1ea46e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/0/106fc050a901b07eac3274f00674cdd42f1ea46e_2_690x307.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"2lp43wY7s0YmnidsmbAn3WMHkD4\" width=\"690\" height=\"307\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/0/106fc050a901b07eac3274f00674cdd42f1ea46e_2_690x307.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/0/106fc050a901b07eac3274f00674cdd42f1ea46e_2_1035x460.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/0/106fc050a901b07eac3274f00674cdd42f1ea46e_2_1380x614.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1919×854 60.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/shaileshsaini/{size}/92114_2.png",
