      "name": "Ransike Randeni",
      "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:26:29.154Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Hemil_Sangani\" data-post=\"6\" data-topic=\"157516\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/ce7236/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Hemil_Sangani:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Document Naming Rule</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>If I want to use this format HR-DSR-{YYYY}-{####}. What should I enter in the “Prefix” in Document Naming Rule?</p>",
