    {
      "id": 487872,
      "username": "shaileshsaini",
      "name": "Shailesh",
      "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:31:31.991Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Write prefix like HR-DSR-.YYYY.-</p>\n<p>For your reference:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Allowed special characters are “/” and “-”</li>\n</ul>\n<p>- Optionally, set the number of digits in the series using dot (.) followed by hashes (#). For example, “.####” means that the series will have four digits. Default is five digits.</p>\n<p>- You can also use variables in the series name by putting them between (.) dots<br>\nSupported Variables:</p>\n<p>- <code>.YYYY.</code> - Year in 4 digits</p>\n<p>- <code>.YY.</code> - Year in 2 digits</p>\n<p>- <code>.MM.</code> - Month</p>\n<p>- <code>.DD.</code> - Day of month</p>\n<p>- <code>.WW.</code> - Week of the year</p>\n<p>- <code>.FY.</code> - Fiscal Year</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/shaileshsaini/{size}/92114_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 10,
      "post_type": 1,
      "like_count": null,
      "like_action": null,
      "Reads": 32,
      "wikis": null,
