    {
      "id": 487942,
      "username": "ransikerandeni",
      "name": "Ransike Randeni",
      "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:08:54.518Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Once we set the prefix in the DocType naming series or from the “Document Naming Rule”, the prefix won’t be displayed in the prefix list in the “Document Naming Settings”. If type the prefix manually without selecting, it’ll set the count globally.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/7/5780ea04294655695549d0e0f712f674c32f1618.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5780ea04294655695549d0e0f712f674c32f1618\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-12-02 at 3.40.39 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/7/5780ea04294655695549d0e0f712f674c32f1618_2_690x295.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-12-02 at 3.40.39 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"cu5JHGiDba01tWLue2AdtijEKko\" width=\"690\" height=\"295\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/7/5780ea04294655695549d0e0f712f674c32f1618_2_690x295.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/7/5780ea04294655695549d0e0f712f674c32f1618_2_1035x442.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/7/5780ea04294655695549d0e0f712f674c32f1618.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9FAFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-12-02 at 3.40.39 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1257×539 36.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/f/6f05df1b44a0f2409af61dfcf9d501373dc173a0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/6f05df1b44a0f2409af61dfcf9d501373dc173a0\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-12-02 at 3.41.18 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optim